r mission: Master your ship, unlock its full potential and hold the line. The galaxy's last hope rests in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAZAR is an intense vertical arcade space shooter where you fight against an alien fleet destroying the galaxy. Battle through the Story Mode or test your skills in Infinity Mode with leaderboards. GAZAR delivers non-stop action, stunning visual effects, and dynamic combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656330/extras/1fd60cd5dbf6d11afeeb163ecc39b2a5.poster.avif?t=1761942210\" width=614 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656330/extras/1fd60cd5dbf6d11afeeb163ecc39b2a5.webm?t=1761942210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656330/extras/1fd60cd5dbf6d11afeeb163ecc39b2a5.mp4?t=1761942210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EPIC CAMPAIGN</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience a story mode with cutscenes that introduce new powerups, elite enemies, and bosses as you progress</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Journey through an expansive campaign spanning multiple star systems and witness the effects of space-time distortion</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656330/extras/5a9d7e29092219f359695d6a3de6ecf4.poster.avif?t=1761942210\" width=614 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai